{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e17-scene-03",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "失踪名单与延播决定  (Missing List and Broadcast Delay)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "As soon as Kaiwen and Xingzi step into Chun Yuqiao's apartment, he cuts past small talk about his health to ask for the latest overseas news. Listen to their Mandarin briefing.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你这两天身体恢复得怎么样了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "别跟我转移话题啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "快跟我说说，欧洲那边的新消息是什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "目前还没有什么最新消息。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "都已经过去两天了，总该有下文了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "官方刚刚确认了失踪者名单，不排除被劫持绑架的可能性。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "除此之外，还有呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "还有就是，好几个极端组织都已经发了声明。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你正在养病，能不能先不要管这些事了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "魅力远航还是延迟播出比较好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你身体要紧，先别折腾了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你这两天身体恢复得怎么样了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, how has your health been recovering over the past two days?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "别跟我转移话题啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not try changing the subject on me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "快跟我说说，欧洲那边的新消息是什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tell me right away—what is the latest news from overseas?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "目前还没有什么最新消息。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is no brand-new word at the moment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "都已经过去两天了，总该有下文了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Two whole days have passed already; there ought to be a follow-up by now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "官方刚刚确认了失踪者名单，不排除被劫持绑架的可能性。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Officials just confirmed the missing-persons list and cannot rule out kidnapping.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "除此之外，还有呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Besides that, what else is there?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "还有就是，好几个极端组织都已经发了声明。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Also, several extremist groups have already issued statements.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你正在养病，能不能先不要管这些事了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, you are supposed to be resting—could you stop worrying over all this for now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "魅力远航还是延迟播出比较好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is better to postpone broadcasting our travel show for now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你身体要紧，先别折腾了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your health comes first—stop wearing yourself out.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你这两天身体恢复得怎么样了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "别跟我转移话题啊。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "快跟我说说，欧洲那边的新消息是什么？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "目前还没有什么最新消息。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "都已经过去两天了，总该有下文了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "官方刚刚确认了失踪者名单，不排除被劫持绑架的可能性。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "除此之外，还有呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "还有就是，好几个极端组织都已经发了声明。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你正在养病，能不能先不要管这些事了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "魅力远航还是延迟播出比较好。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你身体要紧，先别折腾了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Hearing that hostages may have been taken in the attacks, Chun Yuqiao decides their new travel show ought to be postponed. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
